WEBVTT

00:00:26.843 --> 00:00:33.722
dray un tsvontsikster merts nayntsn hundert akht un nayntsik. intervyu mit madam Aranka Knopfler Gold,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.767
Evi Frukhter in Antverpn, BELGIUM, in yidish.

00:00:40.562 --> 00:00:46.985
mayn nomen iz Evi Frukhter. undz ze'mir haynt montik dem dray un tsvontsikstn merts nayntsn hundert akht un nayntsik.

00:00:46.992 --> 00:00:52.689
ikh halt an intervyu mit madam Aranka Knopfler in Antverpn Belgyen.

00:00:56.104 --> 00:00:58.680
madam, ir vilt bite nokh a mol zogn ayer nomen?

00:00:58.821 --> 00:01:02.510
yo, froy Knopfler, Gold Aranka.

00:01:02.888 --> 00:01:09.851
geboyrn in Pishpeklodan nayntsn hundert dray un tsvontsik, zibn may.

00:01:12.135 --> 00:01:14.643
ir kent bukhshtabirn Pishpeklodan?

00:01:14.582 --> 00:01:34.134
yo. P.U.S.P.O.K.L., L.A., D.A.N.Y.

00:01:35.271 --> 00:01:38.133
vi alt zent ir haynt, madam Knopfler?

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:41.458
ikh gey zayn mertseshem finef un zibetsik.

00:01:43.253 --> 00:01:45.103
vi azoy iz ayer yidisher nomen?

00:01:45.008 --> 00:01:46.267
Golde.

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:49.979
un vi azoy hobn ayere eltern geheysn? koydem der tate.

00:01:50.678 --> 00:01:52.596
Avrohom Gold.

00:01:53.209 --> 00:01:54.384
un di mame?

00:01:56.095 --> 00:02:00.392
Ernfeld, Helene oder Khaye.

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:04.374
un vifl geshvister zent ir geven in der heym?

00:02:03.739 --> 00:02:04.863
fir.

00:02:04.937 --> 00:02:06.922
ir kent zogn di nemen bite?

00:02:07.013 --> 00:02:18.599
yo. Hersheli, yidish? Hershl, Golde, Shloyme Leyb, un Perl.

00:02:18.977 --> 00:02:20.962
un dos viflte kind zent ir geven?

00:02:21.357 --> 00:02:22.465
tsveyte.

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:27.324
ir gedenkt nokh di groys-eltern efsher?

00:02:27.297 --> 00:02:29.721
yo, mayn babe zeyde.

00:02:30.047 --> 00:02:37.061
fun ale tsvey zaytn. eyne zaytn di zeyde fun mame's foter.

00:02:37.843 --> 00:02:41.043
un di mayn t- tatn's mame.

00:02:41.421 --> 00:02:45.161
vi azoy hobn zey geheysn di vos ir hot gekent, di groys-eltern?

00:02:45.015 --> 00:02:50.308
reb Osher Ernfeld, mayn mame's tate.

00:02:50.854 --> 00:03:01.243
un mayn tatn's mame, Gold, oder geheyratete NAAM?

00:03:01.637 --> 00:03:04.871
yo, zi iz geven Libe Gold.

00:03:05.637 --> 00:03:08.871
zey hobn gevoynt bay aykh, di groys-eltern vos ir gedenkt?

00:03:07.948 --> 00:03:08.870
yo.

00:03:11.053 --> 00:03:14.523
di eltern zenen oykh geboyrn shoyn in Pishpoklodan?

00:03:13.787 --> 00:03:16.228
NO, neyn.

00:03:16.909 --> 00:03:24.767
mayn tate iz geboyrn in Bartfor Bartfeld.

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:30.943
un mayn mame varshaynlekh in Yirbekun. ikh veys nisht pinktlekh.

00:03:30.713 --> 00:03:34.537
un ir veyst vi azoy zey ongekumen tsu voynen in Pishpoklodan?

00:03:33.143 --> 00:03:37.339
dos veys ikh nisht. yo, ikh veys. der tate iz

00:03:37.378 --> 00:03:41.354
in der ershter WERELDOORLOG iz er ge-

00:03:41.395 --> 00:03:45.371
zey hobn zey GEVLUCHTET fun di rusn,

00:03:45.411 --> 00:03:50.636
in JAHRE f- nayntsn hundert fertsn umgefer.

00:03:51.418 --> 00:04:06.380
un der tate fun mayn tate olev-asholem iz geshtorbn, akht un fertsik yor, zi hot zi hot bakumen a tifus.

00:04:06.792 --> 00:04:14.025
demolts iz geven zeyer a groyse untergang unter di, shoyn geven di OORLOG.

00:04:14.385 --> 00:04:19.661
di ershte WERELDOORLOG, un iz er geshtorbn in di tifus.

00:04:21.979 --> 00:04:25.095
vos hot ayer tate gearbet in Pishpoklodan?

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:29.415
gesheft gehat. ales, fun ales.

00:04:30.703 --> 00:04:34.106
er hot aleyn gearbet in dem gesheft, oder emetser hot im geholfn?

00:04:32.982 --> 00:04:38.150
mayn mame ole-hasholem hot geholfn, un

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:41.990
ven di kinder hobn gevaksn, hobn di kinder geholfn.

00:04:43.714 --> 00:04:46.779
vi azoy hot ir dort gevoynt? in a hoyz, oder in a voynung?

00:04:46.279 --> 00:04:50.812
a hoyz. eygn hoyz gehat imer.

00:04:51.072 --> 00:04:52.905
s'iz geven a groys hoyz?

00:04:52.607 --> 00:04:53.495
yo.

00:04:53.805 --> 00:04:54.980
mit gortn?

00:04:54.615 --> 00:04:57.697
a groys hoyz, mit a groyse hoyf.

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:05.240
un nor dos iz geven nayntsn hundert

00:05:06.917 --> 00:05:14.724
zibn un draysik, hot der shtot fareygnt undzer hoyz,

00:05:14.815 --> 00:05:20.681
vayl s'iz geshtanen punkt in di veg fun fun di groyse veg.

00:05:21.126 --> 00:05:23.060
s'a groyse hoyz geven.

00:05:23.134 --> 00:05:31.785
un demolts hobn zey dos fareygnt un di zey hobn batsolt, azoy az undz ho'mir

00:05:31.842 --> 00:05:40.272
nokh dem gemuzt boyen a ander hoyz oyf der zelber plats, nor mer ineveynik.

00:05:40.617 --> 00:05:42.518
un ir hot geboyt a naye hoyz?

00:05:42.237 --> 00:05:44.543
yo, in akht un draysik.

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:48.171
der tate hot gut fardint fun dem gesheft?

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:51.528
neyn. mir ho'mir aroyfge⟨UNK⟩..

00:05:51.906 --> 00:05:58.498
fun dem hot men nisht gekent koyfn a, nisht boyen a ander hoyz, vos zey hobn batsolt.

00:06:00.462 --> 00:06:02.633
in vos a shule zent ir gegangen?

00:06:02.773 --> 00:06:04.488
yidishe shule.

00:06:05.001 --> 00:06:08.117
s'iz geven meydlekh mit yinglekh oder nisht?

00:06:07.228 --> 00:06:09.449
meydlekh mit yinglekh. yo.

00:06:09.928 --> 00:06:13.567
un biz vifl yor zent ir gegangen in der shule?

00:06:12.325 --> 00:06:13.686
zeks yor.

00:06:15.413 --> 00:06:17.533
un nokh di shule, vos hot ir gemakht?

00:06:17.387 --> 00:06:24.586
hob ikh geholfn in gesheft. un fleg mayn mamen, ales, ales GEARBEITET.

00:06:24.559 --> 00:06:26.628
ir hot nokh epes tsugelernt?

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:29.565
neyen hob ikh oykh gelernt.

00:06:30.162 --> 00:06:34.223
dos hob ikh oykh getun, far far undz eygn.

00:06:35.713 --> 00:06:38.626
far ayer eygn gebroykh. far fremde hot ir nisht geneyt?

00:06:37.722 --> 00:06:41.428
neyn. nor far undz eygn hob ikh geneyt.

00:06:41.535 --> 00:06:43.621
bay vemen hot ir gelernt neyen?

00:06:44.168 --> 00:06:51.536
bay vemen ot iz a geshvesterkind in Vasharoshnamen.

00:06:51.829 --> 00:06:53.510
s'iz geven an ander dorf?

00:06:53.398 --> 00:06:56.581
yo. bisl vayt fun undz.

00:06:57.128 --> 00:07:00.530
un ir hot aleyn dort gelernt, oder nokh mit andere meydlekh tsuzamen?

00:06:59.389 --> 00:07:01.256
nor ikh aleyn.

00:07:03.523 --> 00:07:10.756
vayl dos iz zi iz geven mayn babe's shvesterl tokhter,

00:07:10.932 --> 00:07:19.228
di neyeste, zi hot ershtklasik geneyt, un ikh bin oykh ahingegangen lernen neyen.

00:07:20.415 --> 00:07:23.868
ir hot shoyn gelernt neyen oyf a mashin demolts, oder mit der hant?

00:07:24.027 --> 00:07:33.909
mashin, zikher. zikher mashin. nor mit di ha- mit di fis. nisht mit ELEKTRICITEIT.

00:07:36.413 --> 00:07:38.651
velkhe shprakh hot ir geredt in der heym?

00:07:38.505 --> 00:07:40.861
yidish, ungarish.

00:07:42.589 --> 00:07:47.156
un in der shule hot men gelernt yidishe zakhn oykhet? ikh meyn,

00:07:46.268 --> 00:07:56.639
zikher. davenen, taytsh, yidish-taytsh, un di brokhes, ales ales.

00:07:56.764 --> 00:08:01.888
ale religyeze zakhn ho'mir gelernt in shule.

00:08:01.843 --> 00:08:06.309
s'iz geven a shpetsyel frume shul, oder nor far ale kinder hobn gekent ahingeyn?

00:08:06.568 --> 00:08:14.274
ale yidishe kinder zenen ahingegangen, nor yidishe. un s'geven a,

00:08:13.116 --> 00:08:15.388
s'geven a sakh yidn in ayer dorf?

00:08:15.327 --> 00:08:20.534
hundert tsvontsik mishpokhes zenen geven.

00:08:20.777 --> 00:08:28.179
un vi groys iz dos gantse geven? vifl aynvoyners, veyst ir umgefer dos gantse dorf hot gehat?

00:08:26.937 --> 00:08:32.448
di gantse dorf, vifl hot es gekent zayn?

00:08:35.037 --> 00:08:41.476
nisht keyn groyse dorf, nor, ikh meyn fir, finef toyznt mentshn.

00:08:42.832 --> 00:08:44.666
ikh veys nisht zikher.

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:46.556
un ayer mishpokhe iz geven ortodoks?

00:08:46.478 --> 00:08:47.282
yo.

00:08:48.891 --> 00:08:52.479
s'iz geven veyniker ortodokse mentshn oykhet in dorf?

00:08:52.654 --> 00:09:02.435
yo, zenen geven a por neologn. nor algemeyn ekht ortodokse kehile geven.

00:09:04.062 --> 00:09:06.131
ir zent gegangen in shul dort a mol?

00:09:06.373 --> 00:09:12.375
yo. bay undz iz nisht geven di mode az meydlekh zoln geyn in shul.

00:09:12.769 --> 00:09:23.495
bloyz, nisht nisht shpetsyal gegangen, nor manekhes mol ven ikh bin shoyn greser geven.

00:09:25.307 --> 00:09:27.613
ir hot gehat a rov dort in dorf?

00:09:26.809 --> 00:09:27.748
yo.

00:09:27.855 --> 00:09:29.891
ver? ir gedenkt nokh dem nomen?

00:09:29.644 --> 00:09:33.823
Straser meyn ikh azoy hot er geheysn.

00:09:35.989 --> 00:09:40.758
s'iz geven epes an ORGANISATION far di meydlekh, far di fraye tsayt ikh meyn?

00:09:39.651 --> 00:09:43.799
neyn. nisht shpetsyal.

00:09:43.799 --> 00:09:54.106
shpeter shoyn, gants for di krig hot men beginen a bisele ZIONISMUS tsu farshpreytn, ober

00:09:55.935 --> 00:10:00.283
s'nisht geven, a por ire zenen gegangen.

00:10:00.188 --> 00:10:02.325
ir hot aykh nisht interesirt far dem?

00:10:01.268 --> 00:10:02.443
neyn.

00:10:10.482 --> 00:10:15.454
vi azoy iz es geven mit di goyim dortn? ir hot gehat khavertes oykhet tsvishn zey, oder?

00:10:14.481 --> 00:10:15.639
neyn.

00:10:15.713 --> 00:10:17.192
m'hot zikh nisht gemisht?

00:10:17.046 --> 00:10:23.402
nisht zeyer. azoy ven zenen arayngekumen in di gesheft

00:10:23.577 --> 00:10:30.135
ho'mir zey gekent un, nor shpetsyal frayndshaft ho'mir nisht gemakht.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:34.319
ir hot gefilt az zey zenen gevezn antisemitish?

00:10:33.938 --> 00:10:46.132
neyn. eynfakhe poyern. nisht nisht vilde, nor dokh a yid iz a yid un s'iz azoy.

00:10:47.083 --> 00:10:50.975
mir ho'mir zikh nisht geinteresirt eyner nokh di andere.

00:10:51.471 --> 00:10:56.072
zey hobn gehat a gants ander lebn, yo? a yidish meydl

00:10:56.382 --> 00:11:04.054
geyt nisht in a bal, un zi iz gants andersh.

00:11:04.482 --> 00:11:09.471
iber hoypt undz ze'mir geven zeyer a frume mishpokhe.

00:11:10.607 --> 00:11:17.739
ober tsvishn di yidn un di goyim in algemeyn iz geven sholemdik, oder m- s'iz geven,

00:11:16.378 --> 00:11:23.766
yo. yo. kemayse sholemdik geven. s'iz gants andersh geven nor vi bay mayn man.

00:11:23.766 --> 00:11:34.125
bay man iz ekht groyse rishes geven imer. bay undz iz mer eynfakhere un nisht azoy raykhe goyim geven.

00:11:35.599 --> 00:11:39.660
un m'hot zikh ge- fartrogn.

00:11:41.573 --> 00:11:46.292
un in draysiker yorn, vi azoy hot zikh dos antviklt? s'iz nisht gevorn antisemitish?

00:11:47.175 --> 00:11:50.746
a por ire. nisht, ikh ken nisht zogn az

00:11:50.787 --> 00:11:59.364
dos gantse shtot. s'iz geven oysgeshribn UNK.

00:11:59.364 --> 00:12:00.787
VERSTEHEN MICH?

00:12:00.152 --> 00:12:02.744
 kent es iberzetsn?

00:12:01.266 --> 00:12:16.937
az s'kumt tsu bay di natsyonale SOZIALISMUS unter zeyer di FLAG.

00:12:20.503 --> 00:12:25.576
nor andersh, s'iz geven a por shkheynim reshoim, nor

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:32.259
mir ho'mir gehat shpetsyal keyn fun zey tsu rishes.

00:12:33.396 --> 00:12:41.488
nor demolts ven mir ze'mir tsurikgekumen fun deportirn, demolts ho'mir mer rishes gehat fun zey.

00:12:41.488 --> 00:12:48.999
vayl z- m- zey hobn tsugenumen di yidishe ales, ales, di gantse hoyz hobn zey oysgeroybt.

00:12:51.267 --> 00:13:01.017
un natirlekh zey hobn moyre gehat az m'vet aveknemen fun zey di zakhn, un zenen shir tsepuket gevorn.

00:13:02.539 --> 00:13:13.012
yetst nokh a por mol bin ikh geven in mayn geburte-shtot, un zeyer groyse reshoim geven mankhike.

00:13:13.525 --> 00:13:19.728
azoy az m'hot nisht gehat keyn VRIENDSCHAP fun zey.

00:13:20.325 --> 00:13:25.077
vu vu umgefer in Ungarn iz dos dor- dorf gelign, Pe- Pesh-

00:13:24.865 --> 00:13:33.043
dos iz bay Debretsen. Hoydosoboslou, Pishpeklodan, dos iz a

00:13:33.488 --> 00:13:40.671
zeyer a groyse tse- UNK POINT. dos iz

00:13:40.727 --> 00:13:56.246
dort kumen tsuzamen di sakh fun der gantser gegnt. der bay der ban. di farbindungen. un,

00:13:55.915 --> 00:13:59.199
ir zent a mol geforn keyn Debretsin far der krig?

00:13:57.957 --> 00:13:59.537
yo, a sakh mol.

00:13:59.695 --> 00:14:01.005
vos hot men dort getun?

00:14:00.218 --> 00:14:09.122
a sakh mol, vayl dort zenen iz geven di groys-handl, bin ikh gegangen aynkoyfn fun gesheft a sakh zakhn.

00:14:10.866 --> 00:14:13.121
vi lang iz men geforn biz Debretsin?

00:14:13.667 --> 00:14:21.288
vi lang? s'iz fuftsik kilometer geven. nisht lang. a shtunde?

00:14:22.425 --> 00:14:24.697
un dos gedenk ikh shoyn nisht.

00:14:25.311 --> 00:14:29.923
dos heyst ir zent a sakh mol geforn aynkoyfn, di andere geshvister oykhet, oder?

00:14:27.235 --> 00:14:37.995
yo. yo, mayn bruder. der elterer bruder er iz zeyer a groyser geshefts-mentsh geven.

00:14:41.393 --> 00:14:48.289
vi azoy hot zikh dos lebn farendert in ayer dorf nokh dem vos, nokh akht un draysik?

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:52.963
nokh akht un draysiker? ZO,

00:14:53.914 --> 00:15:00.776
ikh gedenk nit a mol shpetsyal az s'iz geven epes shpetsyale groysishes, nor

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:10.702
azoy az Pishpeklodan iz geven aza farteyler far ale, di soldatn zenen dort tsuzamengekumen, zeyer a sakh doytshe soldatn

00:15:10.702 --> 00:15:18.613
zenen gekumen. ikh hob nisht, undz ho'mir nisht azoy gut gefilt, vayl i- ale zenen zey arayngekumen in gesheft,

00:15:18.687 --> 00:15:31.658
m'hot zey badint, menkhinke daytshe soldatn zenen nokh arayngekumen in shtub. zey zenen oykh nor mentshn geven, azoy yunge kinder un s'hot zey geshmekt araynkumen in a shtub.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:39.824
un zey hobn zeyer, ven zenen avekgegangen, zenen hobn zey zikh mamesh gezegnt.

00:15:41.367 --> 00:15:48.380
zey hobn ayngekoyft in gesheft un UNK zenen oykh arayngekumen.

00:15:48.471 --> 00:15:51.823
dos heyst ir, vi lang hot ir nokh gekent dos gesheft haltn?

00:15:52.167 --> 00:15:56.683
biz tsu di letste, biz fir un fertsiker,

00:15:58.849 --> 00:16:03.807
pinktlekh veys ikh nisht, nor ikh meyn az nokh peysekh fir un fertsik

00:16:03.807 --> 00:16:07.719
ze'mir arayn in geto biz nokh shvues.

00:16:08.333 --> 00:16:11.229
un dem eltern bruder hot men nisht genumen tsu militer?

00:16:10.915 --> 00:16:17.372
er iz geven a soldat, yo. a soldat geven un fun dort hot men im zikher

00:16:17.496 --> 00:16:24.172
far ARBEIT'S lager. m'hot er iz punkt geven a soldat, mamesh.

00:16:23.908 --> 00:16:26.281
in velkhn yor iz er gevorn a soldat?

00:16:27.267 --> 00:16:38.921
in velkhe yor? dos iz in fertsik, er iz geboyrn nayn un tsvontsik, dos iz tsvontsik yor shpeter,

00:16:39.855 --> 00:16:42.751
eyn un fertsik, tsvey un fertsik.

00:16:41.661 --> 00:16:44.844
iz er shoyn firer iz er geven soldat.

00:16:43.365 --> 00:16:46.008
yo, shoyn lang vi beginen.

00:16:46.572 --> 00:16:48.304
der yingerer bruder nisht?

00:16:48.647 --> 00:16:54.209
der yingerer bruder nisht. er iz nor shpeter arayngegangen

00:16:55.414 --> 00:16:59.525
oyf a ARBEITS- demolts ven s'shoyn geven ARBEITS-lager.

00:17:01.287 --> 00:17:04.740
ir hot geha- gehat genug esn in di krigs yorn?

00:17:03.902 --> 00:17:11.185
yo. m'hot gehat genug esn. s'iz nor m'hot nor gebroykht esn broyn broyt.

00:17:11.428 --> 00:17:16.400
demolts hot men nisht gevust az dos iz beser un gezunter.

00:17:16.592 --> 00:17:20.807
s'iz geven a gantse TRAGEDIE nebekh, mayn mame hot gekoyft a

00:17:20.807 --> 00:17:25.580
a z- azoy a UNK, vi azoy zogt men dos, UNK,

00:17:25.924 --> 00:17:31.959
zipn, iberzipn az s'zol nisht broyn zayn. yo.

00:17:32.252 --> 00:17:34.220
m'hot aleyn gebakn dos broyt?

00:17:34.007 --> 00:17:39.063
m- ho'mir aleyn gebakn, nor baym beker, nor aleyn geknetn.

00:17:39.205 --> 00:17:47.147
un azoy hot men es getrogn tsum beker un s'iz zeyer fayn geven.

00:17:54.544 --> 00:17:59.111
biz nayntsn fir un fertsik hot ir gekent normal lebn?

00:17:59.353 --> 00:18:04.680
yo. nokh dem iz men leyder arayn in geto.

00:18:04.534 --> 00:18:09.843
vos iz geshen, ve- ir gedenkt ven di daytshn zenen arayngekumen nayntsn fir un fertsik?

00:18:09.428 --> 00:18:12.037
ikh bin geven punkt in Budapest.

00:18:12.938 --> 00:18:25.504
un demolts vayl ikh hob gebroykht VLUCHTEN, a por monat bin ikh nisht in der heym geven, vayl ikh hob geholfn far a soldat, geholfn,

00:18:26.944 --> 00:18:37.485
dos heyst azoy az ikh hob geholfn. m'hot dos oyf mir geshmirt, far yidishe mener bafrayen.

00:18:38.284 --> 00:18:48.144
vayl s'iz geven eyn soldat vos er hot gearbet epes az far groys gelt hot er gekent bafrayen, ober

00:18:48.144 --> 00:18:59.675
in WERKELIJKHEID iz es nisht geven azoy. un demolts hob ikh hob ikh mir zeyer azoy UNK, ikh hob gezogt far mayn tatn az ikh for avek.

00:18:59.901 --> 00:19:03.053
ikh hob ikh hob gefilt az m'muz avekforn.

00:19:03.053 --> 00:19:13.564
ikh hob gevust az oyf mir tuen zey es aroyfleygn, az ikh hob geredt mit dem soldat az er zol bafrayen di mentshn.

00:19:13.671 --> 00:19:26.759
un s'iz take zeyer gut geven az ikh bin avekgeforn, a demolts iz es gut geven. un un a por monat bin i- bin ikh geven bay mayn tante in SOLTVADKERT.

00:19:27.323 --> 00:19:36.429
un un nokh dem bin ikh aheymge- yo, m'hot take ale meydlekh tsuzamenge-

00:19:36.537 --> 00:19:46.133
gerufn un der soldat hot gez- un m'hot gezogt far dem soldat er zol vayzn velkhe meydl iz dos geven.

00:19:46.543 --> 00:19:48.646
hot er nisht getrofn.

00:19:49.041 --> 00:19:56.240
ikh bin take geven a mol in a KOCSMA, v- visn SIE vos dos iz?

00:19:56.466 --> 00:20:05.656
un ikh hob geredt mit im a por vorter, vegn eyner hot mikh zeyer gebetn, a Sarvasher mishpokhe,

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:09.735
az ikh zol prubirn epes tsu tun, er iz a kranker mentsh geven.

00:20:09.735 --> 00:20:16.895
ikh hob prubirt, ober s'iz nisht, zenen zey, hot men mikh nisht getrofn.

00:20:14.877 --> 00:20:17.959
vos hot men gev -gevolt fun aykh vos ir zol im zogn?

00:20:18.589 --> 00:20:28.084
az er zo- az er zol kenen bafrayen dem mentsh. az m'get UNK get vifl er vil,

00:20:28.292 --> 00:20:31.593
nor nor zol bafrayen dem mentsh.

00:20:30.756 --> 00:20:34.766
der iz ayngeshpart der mentsh? oder v- vo- vos iz?

00:20:33.152 --> 00:20:38.731
neyn, nor in MUNKASZOL- in ARBEITS-lager, dort in Pishpoklodan.

00:20:38.873 --> 00:20:44.166
ober s'iz shver geven epes tsu tun zeyer in

00:20:44.492 --> 00:20:49.110
azoy az ikh bin nisht in der heym geven, hot men mikh nisht gekhapt, un

00:20:50.095 --> 00:21:03.268
koym a por verter hob ikh mit im geredt un shoyn ho- hot men gevust az ikh bin dos geven. un ikh bin dort geven in bay mayn tante azoy a fir, finef monat.

00:21:05.653 --> 00:21:08.144
un nokh dem zent ir gegangen keyn Budapest?

00:21:07.948 --> 00:21:15.215
nokh dem, yo, fun dort bin ikh gegangen nokh Budapest, dort hot gevoynt a zun fun mayn tante.

00:21:15.238 --> 00:21:27.736
un ikh bin bay zey geven a por tog un punkt in tsvishn zenen di daytsher arayngekumen. s'iz geven marts eyn un tsvontsik, oder, ikh veys nit a mol.

00:21:28.603 --> 00:21:36.225
ZO in marts. in fir un fertsik. fir un fertsik, yo.

00:21:36.602 --> 00:21:40.764
damolts zenen di daytsher arayngekumen, un

00:21:42.053 --> 00:21:49.809
ikh bin demolts bay nakht, vayl az m'iz umshuldik hot men nisht keyn moyre.

00:21:50.355 --> 00:22:05.806
un ikh bin gants azoy fra- frank un fray geforn oyfn tsug aheym. s'iz ful geven mit soldatn un keyner hot nit a mol geredt tsu mir azoy a vort, gornisht, un s'hot mir gornisht geshen.

00:21:59.434 --> 00:22:00.787
mit vos a min solda-

00:22:05.205 --> 00:22:07.308
ungarishe oder daytshe soldatn?

00:22:07.112 --> 00:22:08.844
da- ungarishe.

00:22:09.154 --> 00:22:17.248
un tsu un demolts, dey nakht, hot men azoy fil yidn tsuzamengenumen, hob ikh gekhapt

00:22:17.271 --> 00:22:26.141
yederer iz geven unter zey, oykh eyn bruder fun mayn man hot men demolts geinternirt.

00:22:26.653 --> 00:22:31.743
nor ikh bin aheymgegangen besholem. yo.

00:22:31.429 --> 00:22:36.485
ir hot gevust, tsvishn di yidn hot men gevust vos dos badoytet az di daytshn kumen?

00:22:36.745 --> 00:22:40.164
a zikher hot men gevust, s'iz shreklekh geven.

00:22:40.187 --> 00:22:44.400
ikh bin in Budapest geven un o s'shreklekh geven.

00:22:44.659 --> 00:22:49.884
un mayne eltern hobn nisht gevust keyn radyo, keyn gornisht.

00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:54.119
s'iz geven a zuntik, zuntik nokh mitog, un

00:22:54.126 --> 00:23:05.460
ikh bin, ven di daytsher zenen arayngekumen, un ikh bin aheymgekumen hob ikh es fartseylt mayne eltern, zenen zeyer troyerik gevorn.

00:23:07.373 --> 00:23:10.927
ir hot gehert in Budapest az di daytshn zenen arayngekumen?

00:23:07.420 --> 00:23:08.700
hob ikh,

00:23:09.229 --> 00:23:18.014
yo zikher, ikh bin dort geven, ikh hob zey gezen ven di Firer's soldatn vi zey zenen gekumen.

00:23:18.679 --> 00:23:21.474
un ven zey zenen arayngekumen bay aykh in dorf?

00:23:22.240 --> 00:23:27.583
kimat, imer zenen geven a por.

00:23:28.821 --> 00:23:35.700
nor demolts yo zenen zey gekumen shoyn noent for der deportatsye.

00:23:36.043 --> 00:23:40.593
zenen gekumen arayn in gesheft un zey hobn ayngekoyft un.

00:23:41.123 --> 00:23:46.685
nu mit zey ho'mir oykh nisht gehat gor keyn, mayn tate olev-asholem mit der bord

00:23:46.877 --> 00:23:50.350
iz geven in gesheft, zey hobn keyn eyn vort nisht gezogt.

00:23:50.350 --> 00:24:01.552
ot azoy, zey zey zenen oykh geven oyf tsores, di soldatn vos, zey hobn undz nisht nisht geshlogn, nisht ge-

00:24:02.233 --> 00:24:06.429
gor keyn NACHTEIL ho'mir nisht gefilt fun zey.

00:24:07.431 --> 00:24:17.195
ober, a moshl far far fir un fertsik, di yidn hobn gevust, di yidn in ayer dorf hobn shoyn gevust vos m'makht mit yidn? fun di deportatsyes hot men gehat gehert shoyn epes?

00:24:16.948 --> 00:24:29.362
ikh ekhtik veys ikh nisht, neyn. m'hot nisht gevust. mamesh m'hot gornisht gevust foroys.

00:24:29.571 --> 00:24:36.167
ken zayn zenen geven mentshn ver s'hobn gevust un zenen avek ge-

00:24:36.167 --> 00:24:39.805
ober nisht a sakh. fun di dorfn nisht a sakh.

00:24:39.805 --> 00:24:49.241
efsher groyse ashirim vos zenen gegangen oyf oysland. nor nisht fil.

00:24:49.703 --> 00:24:56.751
algemeyn, di eynfakhe folk, der hot go- gornisht gevust.

00:24:57.921 --> 00:25:04.918
m'hot undz mamesh azoy getrogn nebekh oyf vi a a ku oyfn shlakhtfeld.

00:25:07.118 --> 00:25:10.014
m'hot nisht gevust leyder gornisht.

00:25:11.202 --> 00:25:20.342
un oyf dem hot men zikher nisht gerikh- gedenkt vos iz nebekh geshen.

00:25:21.900 --> 00:25:28.964
azoy ven, ir veyst nokh in velkhn tog di daytshn zenen arayngekumen bay aykh in dorf, ikh meyn emesdik?

00:25:27.351 --> 00:25:32.070
neyn, dos ken ikh nisht visn. dos ken ikh nisht pinktlekh visn.

00:25:32.413 --> 00:25:34.837
un vos iz geshen dan?

00:25:35.113 --> 00:25:37.874
dort in dorf iz gornisht geshen.

00:25:38.758 --> 00:25:53.416
in dorf nisht, dort in in Budapest dort hobn zey tsamgekhapt di yidn un zey hobn gedenkt. zey hobn getun mit zey vos zey hobn gevolt. s'geven far zey frayheyt.

00:25:55.127 --> 00:25:58.918
ven hot men der, hot men gemakht nokh dem a geto in

00:25:58.637 --> 00:25:59.508
yo.

00:25:58.975 --> 00:26:00.150
ayer dorf?

00:26:00.493 --> 00:26:01.297
yo.

00:26:01.101 --> 00:26:03.609
ven hot dos ongehoybn, veyst ir dos nokh?

00:26:02.957 --> 00:26:11.375
ikh ikh meyn az nokh peysekh oder for peysekh, s- ikh gedenk nisht ekht genoy.

00:26:11.375 --> 00:26:13.312
m'iz nisht lang geven.

00:26:14.145 --> 00:26:16.113
vi azoy hot men gemakht dem geto?

00:26:16.187 --> 00:26:20.332
ikh meyn v- vi hot men bashlosn vu der geto iz?

00:26:20.878 --> 00:26:27.633
dos punkt di shul iz arayngefaln, un di shule,

00:26:27.633 --> 00:26:36.752
un a groyse sht- ZO di gantse yidishe gemeynde azoy ken ikh zogn, ZO.

00:26:38.277 --> 00:26:47.198
oykh goyim zenen azoy arayngefaln. zey hot men aroysgeshikt, ikh meyn. zenen gegangen voynen in di yidishe hayzer

00:26:47.760 --> 00:26:51.922
vos m'hot farlozt. undz ho'mir oykh ales dort gelozt in,

00:26:52.350 --> 00:26:55.331
ayer hoyz iz nisht arayngefaln in der geto gegnt?

00:26:55.033 --> 00:26:57.879
punkt kegn iber ho'mir gevoynt.

00:26:58.324 --> 00:27:00.731
hot ir gemuzt aroysgeyn fun ayer hoyz.

00:26:59.809 --> 00:27:01.170
a zikher.

00:27:01.429 --> 00:27:03.515
un dan vu hot ir gevoynt in geto?

00:27:03.657 --> 00:27:06.739
dort hobn zey gegebn epes a voynung.

00:27:06.880 --> 00:27:09.861
s'geven merere mishpokhes tsuzamen, oder?

00:27:08.922 --> 00:27:09.878
yo.

00:27:10.356 --> 00:27:22.719
undz ze'mir geven oykh tsuzamen geven mit mayn feter un, tsvey feters oykh meyn ikh. yederer hot gehat a shtibl, di familyes.

00:27:23.063 --> 00:27:25.689
vifl mentshn hot men gevoynt in eyn shtub?

00:27:27.771 --> 00:27:30.971
ikh meyn a a familye in a shtub.

00:27:31.281 --> 00:27:33.367
dos iz nisht a sakh geven.

00:27:33.373 --> 00:27:35.341
a shtub, dos heyst eyn tsimer?

00:27:35.685 --> 00:27:36.641
yo.

00:27:37.035 --> 00:27:39.492
un s'iz geven efsher ekstere a kokh.

00:27:40.123 --> 00:27:43.864
m'hot gekokht, keyn fleysh hot men nisht gehat.

00:27:44.190 --> 00:27:49.061
un s'iz in tsvishn gefaln shvues, dos gedenk ikh.

00:27:49.185 --> 00:27:53.634
peysekh gedenk ikh nisht. UNK.

00:27:54.670 --> 00:28:05.143
un shvues yo, fleysh hot men nisht gehat, m'hot ge- di froyen hobn gemakht fun dem fun yene fun khale, fun broyt.

00:28:05.318 --> 00:28:10.846
azoy epes a UNK fun fleysh.

00:28:10.735 --> 00:28:13.736
OK, e'mir makhn a kleyne pauze, vayl m'darf toyshn.

00:28:12.456 --> 00:28:13.111
yo.
